My badminton things are in Mexico.
Therefore, I need a racket to play.
I ask the manager for a racket.
"Can I rent a racket from here?" I ask.
"Certainly you can take one," he says.
"The rent is fifty rupees for one hour."
I give him fifty rupees.
He gives me a new racket.
I take that racket in my hand.
I swing it slowly once.
It does not have much weight.
I can play well with this.
"Is this racket okay?" he asks.
"This is very good."
"I like this," I say.
"I am going to play now."
He smiles happily.
I walk to the court with the racket.
